se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nOn a production line in a factory, worker Xiao Yang is inspecting the products. He tells supervisor Xiao Wang, \"We produce 40 products today, most of them are qualified, some are substandard, but there are hardly any waste products.\" Xiao Wang checks the quality inspection report and finds only 5 substandard products.\n\n[Question]\nAfter checking the quality inspection report, how many qualified products does Xiao Wang estimate?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. After checking the quality inspection report, Xiao Wang estimates there are 25 qualified products.\nB. After checking the quality inspection report, Xiao Wang estimates there are 30 qualified products.\nC. After checking the quality inspection report, Xiao Wang estimates there are 20 qualified products.\nD. After checking the quality inspection report, Xiao Wang estimates there are 35 qualified products.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001926698327168686,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e207d6006945d2801372","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368007820,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:33:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"5c17d02db52b42d1b0a9281cae7b24a0"}